","text":"I can name a practical resource that helps me settle.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.03","text":"I know when I need a break from a demanding situation.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.04","text":"I can return attention to ordinary tasks after a strong feeling.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.05","text":"I can choose a supportive environment for myself.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.06","text":"I recognise how rest influences my sense of stability.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.07","text":"I can ask for simple practical help when needed.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.08","text":"I can slow my pace without treating it as failure.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.09","text":"I notice physical tension before it becomes exhausting.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.10","text":"I can describe a sensation without guessing its cause.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.11","text":"I can tell when a position is comfortable for me.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.12","text":"I notice bodily signals that indicate I need rest.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.13","text":"I can shift attention away from sensations if needed.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.14","text":"I can enjoy simple pleasant sensory experiences.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.15","text":"I can adjust the intensity of a body practice.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.16","text":"I respect physical limits during group activities.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.17","text":"I can recognise what I am feeling in a close interaction.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.18","text":"I can communicate warmth without expecting a particular response.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.19","text":"I can ask for empathy in clear words.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.20","text":"I can recognise when I would rather keep a feeling private.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.21","text":"I can hear another person's emotions without taking responsibility for fixing them.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.22","text":"I can accept care when it feels welcome.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.23","text":"I can acknowledge vulnerability without self-criticism.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.24","text":"I can appreciate quiet connection without forcing emotional intensity.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.25","text":"I ask before assuming physical contact is welcome.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.26","text":"I can express my no in an appropriate situation.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.27","text":"I treat another person's no as enough.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.28","text":"I can ask clarifying questions about expectations.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.29","text":"I can change my mind about an activity.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.30","text":"I can respect different needs for space or touch.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.31","text":"I can discuss a boundary without blaming someone.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.32","text":"I understand that past agreement never guarantees present consent.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.33","text":"I can recognise what feels comfortable to me in an intimate context.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.34","text":"I do not treat any level of sexual desire as obligatory.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.35","text":"I can accept that my preferences may change over time.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.36","text":"I can set a limit even when I care deeply for someone.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.37","text":"I can value my body without comparing it with others.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.38","text":"I can describe a personal preference without feeling obliged to act on it.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.39","text":"I respect different choices about intimacy, including abstinence.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.40","text":"I can notice feelings of shame without defining myself by them.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.41","text":"I can notice when my attention has wandered.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.42","text":"I can return attention gently without scolding myself.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.43","text":"I can tolerate a short quiet pause without needing a result.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.44","text":"I can notice thoughts without treating each as a fact.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.45","text":"I can choose not to meditate when it feels unsuitable.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.46","text":"I can be curious about an experience without exaggerating it.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.47","text":"I can accept that different days bring different levels of focus.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.48","text":"I can end a practice and return to daily life comfortably.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.49","text":"I can try a gentle new movement if I want to.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.50","text":"I can express myself creatively without seeking approval.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.51","text":"I can experiment within boundaries that feel safe.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.52","text":"I accept that others may enjoy different forms of expression.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.53","text":"I can let an activity be playful without making it a test.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.54","text":"I can recognise when I prefer stillness to movement.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.55","text":"I can offer an idea without needing everyone to like it.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.56","text":"I can stop an exploration that no longer suits me.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.57","text":"I can name a personal value guiding my practice.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.58","text":"I can enjoy symbolism without confusing it with physical measurement.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.59","text":"I can respect spiritual interpretations different from mine.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.60","text":"I can reflect on an experience without claiming it proves hidden forces.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.61","text":"I can recognise practical changes that matter to me.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.62","text":"I can choose a practice because it fits my values.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.63","text":"I can compare how I feel over time without demanding progress every day.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.64","text":"I can keep meaningful insights connected to ordinary responsibilities.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"}],"optionalContext":[],"suggestedRepeatDays":30,"contentHash":"sha256:72316429e24db82e55ab88b7f85b2ac33e36dd0a380a40d9e54597f79d04287e"},{"id":"c7b20006-1710-4a00-8d11-202610170002","key":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait","version":"v1","instrumentLocale":"ru","translationVersion":"hh-ru-v1","timeframe":"past-30-days","scoringKey":"configured","scoringVersion":"v1","resultVersion":"v1","title":"Тантрический личностный портрет и развитие","source":{"title":"Holistic House — Tantric Personality & Development Portrait","status":"original-non-diagnostic-tantric-reflection","reviewedAt":"2026-10-17"},"answerScale":{"min":0,"max":4},"responseAnchors":["Совсем нет","Немного","Отчасти","В значительной степени","Очень сильно"],"scoring":{"dimensions":[{"key":"resources.tantric.tantric_personality_portrait.grounded","method":"mean","items":["hh-tantric-personality-portrait.01","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.02","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.03","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.04","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.05","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.06","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.07","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.08"],"min":0,"max":4,"dimensionClass":"resources","sourceConstruct":"Устойчивость и опора","direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"key":"resources.tantric.tantric_personality_portrait.body_awareness","method":"mean","items":["hh-tantric-personality-portrait.09","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.10","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.11","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.12","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.13","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.14","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.15","hh-tantric-personality-portrait.16"],"min":0,"max":4,"dimensio